# Formspree form id used by the consultation-inquiry dialog (issue #13,
# lib/formspree.ts). Sign up at https://formspree.io, create a form, and set
# this to the id segment of the endpoint Formspree gives you
# (https://formspree.io/f/<this-part>). Required at BUILD time — this is a
# static-export site (docs §3.1), so NEXT_PUBLIC_* vars are inlined by
# `next build` and there is no runtime env lookup to fall back on. Without
# this set, the consultation dialog renders but shows a "not configured yet"
# error on submit instead of attempting a request.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=
